# Generated by scripts/build_from_poems_by_sex.py. dcterms:creator
# from poems_by_sex; waka:headnote/waka:ku/dcterms:subject from
# generate_waka_fields.py (Nichibunken for Kokin/Gosen/Shui/
# Goshuishu's ku+部立, UVA JTI for Goshuishu's headnote -- see that
# module's docstring). No dcterms:isPartOf/waka:hasOccurrence yet
# -- isPartOf needs waka:Book resources for all four anthologies'
# 巻, not built this round (only 部立/topic was asked for);
# hasOccurrence needs hachidaishu.xml tokenization, separate step.
# 5105 waka total across kokin/gosen/shuui/goshuui.
#
# Four shuui poems (1181-1184) get two dcterms:creator values from
# accumulating one row in *_female.txt and one in *_male.txt for
# the same poem number -- the same kami-no-ku/shimo-no-ku joint-
# composition phenomenon as the hand-built wakaid:shuishu-1181 in
# waka-example.ttl, except here both authors are named (藤原忠君/
# 良岑義方女 etc.), not anonymous placeholders. wakaid:shuui-1181
# (this file) and wakaid:shuishu-1181 (waka-example.ttl) are
# therefore two different URIs for what's arguably the same poem
# -- not reconciled yet, flagged for follow-up.
#
# poems_by_sex/Nichibunken/UVA numbering is directly aligned (no
# offset needed between them); this is NOT the same as hachidaishu's
# own numbering, which has its own +1 offsets for Gosenshu/
# Goshuishu found in verify_kokin_gosen_shui.py -- not applied here.
#
# waka:voiceGenderSwitched is asserted true/false on every waka
# (poems_by_sex's "!" marker -- named-file name-suffix or
# *_unknown.txt's y/n/?! tag-suffix, same marker, decoupled from
# dcterms:creator as of 2026-08-09, see design-notes.md).
# waka:poeticVoice is only asserted when true, pointing at
# person:anonymous-female-unknown-status (unknown-gender default,
# not a claim about the actual target's identity).

